00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:10.280
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:30.910
Ichigo.

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:32.230
Smile, smile!

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.310
Sweets must be made with happy feelings.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.730
You're right.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.510
After all, people love sweets.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.990
It must be made to convey the happiness I wish for them.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.090
Woohoo! It's snowing!

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:54.100
Beautiful.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.800
How long are you going to mess around?

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.230
Let's get going.

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:03.480
recipe 13

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:03.480
Happy Sweets Dream

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:09.040
Look! It turned out so pretty.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.640
Thank you. It's all thanks to Vanilla.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:12.710
We did it!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.590
Yay~!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:19.720
Having special training alone, Ichigo's dream to become a pâtissière is getting closer.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.690
Then let me hurry and taste the crèpe pastry.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.170
What are you doing?

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.560
I will go back to the Kingdom of Sweets after this.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.300
Eh!? Vanilla is going back home?

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:33.600
I see...

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.150
Will you come too?

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.860
Eh? Can I go to the Kingdom of Sweets?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.520
That's a simple thing to do if I use Sweets Spirits magic. Coming?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.540
I'm going, I'm going, I'm going! I'm definitely going!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.820
Vanilla ranran, makaron ron!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.040
I'm dressed like a dinosaur just like Vanilla, how horrible!

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.730
I'm not a dinosaur at all!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.130
If you don't hurry up and come, I'm going to leave you behind.

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:09.310
I see. Since I shrunk you, and since you're not a spirit you can't fly.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.850
You could have told me that earlier.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.380
Ichigo, you're heavy!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:19.010
You're rude! I've only gone up 2kg since I came here...

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:19.980
As I thought.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.080
Sorry.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.770
Awesome! They're all Spirits.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.590
Eh, that's natural, huh?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.640
This train is bound for the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.480
Ah! It's a chocolate waterfall!

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.780
It's called Chocolat Fall.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:56.220
Hey, wait a second, it was night just now, right?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:05:00.980
In the Kingdom of Sweets, the flow of time is slightly slower than the human world.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.730
What's this river? It's sparkling like candy.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:04.990
It's called the Candy river.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:07.850
We are about to reach the last stop.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:08.490
The last stop?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:13.410
We came here through the oven, but there are entrances everywhere in the academy.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.080
And so these entrances join together.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.590
So this means there will be more passengers boarding the train, right?

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.700
That's right.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.880
It's Ichigo.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.970
What are you here?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:27.760
Right.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.400
Hey, this is a big annual event, why did you bring Ichigo along with you?

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:35.500
You don't need to speak of me like that, you mean spirit.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.430
What was that!?

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:37.990
Please don't fight!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:43.120
You need the permission of the Queen before you can bring humans into the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.120
Be quiet. I don't know it.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.910
Vanilla did it on purpose.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.030
What's this? The castle?

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.210
It's the Queen's castle.

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.910
The Queen is... The one in St. Marie?

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:59.460
That's right. Behind this castle is the academy, where we study hard together,

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:03.910
and if we are allowed to, search for a partner in the human world.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:07.390
So that's how it was. Then you will become top-class pâtissières, right?

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:08.980
Top-class pâtissières!

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:12.570
Hey, this is not the time to fool around, we're gonna be busy today.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:13.600
That's right...

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.940
First off, we need to get the ingredients for the celebration.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:19.660
You've said that earlier, but what is the celebration?

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.210
Ghost Sweets festival...

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.690
It's Newear's celebration!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:27.900
Oh, I see, I see... So what's a Newear's celebration?

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.160
What did the celebration originate from?

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.100
Who knows?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:36.120
It's a little difficult, but we've always call it "Newear".

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.130
Ah. I see. But I won't understand the meaning if you just say "Newear".

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:45.460
It's when all the Sweets Spirits get together and create huge sweets annually.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.300
It's a big event to enjoy those sweets with the Queen.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:52.340
The same time when the new year comes, we will eat them together!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:56.260
Sounds fun! Let me join too, let me join too.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.520
All right. In exchange for that...

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:00.870
Please wait.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.860
This is majipan fruits.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:04.850
No way.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:07.850
See.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:09.030
It's really majipan!

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.100
These are bananas, right?

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.860
That's wrong! It's chocolate.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.970
This is a coffee tree.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.120
Is that cabbage?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.330
That's wrong.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:20.960
It's vanilla.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.170
Wh-What's wrong with the Kingdom of Sweets!?

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:31.910
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:31.910
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:36.040
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro...

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:36.040
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured...

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:36.050
Why must I carry this heavy luggage!?

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:40.270
That's obvious. If you want to participate in the Newear's celebration,

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.270
you have to work hard.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.290
Do you think you can participate without lifting a finger, Ichigo?

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.830
If you want to eat cakes, then you have to work.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.780
There isn't a free cake in the world.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:53.290
Eh? Doesn't everyone participate in it, too?

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.480
We have a job for making sweets.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:02.740
Humans can't participate in the making of sweets, so this is the only thing you can do.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.360
Let's hurry up and get going.
We don't have much time.

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:09.040
If we don't have much time, it'd be much faster if everyone just flew.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.510
It's the "Jerks"!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:19.100
So what!?

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.250
What are you doing, Kashi?

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.380
Let Ichigo go already.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:28.610
Shut up! This is our territory.
We won't let you take sweets as you want!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:31.600
Whatever grows in the forest belongs to everyone.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.780
Precisely. You can't take everything for yourselves.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.480
It's three of us!

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.330
How many are there?

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.790
You three...

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:40.440
Wait a second.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:41.330
Wh-What is it?

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:46.770
Chocolate is our specialty.
Tempering king, Kashi!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:51.170
If it's red beans, I'm the Kingdom of Sweets number 1, Nenderu Andi.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:55.650
My Sweets Crafting can melt any girls' heart.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.890
Rose's count, Narcy.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.880
The three of us together are... The Jerk Brigade!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.640
Wh-What are these people?

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.980
That's right!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.680
What are you doing so suddenly, Chocolat?

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:13.990
You three aren't going to the Academy and you're doing these kind of things!?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.410
You do those kind of things all the time...

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.200
Shut up!

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:20.700
For now we'll take her with us.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.200
I won't let you do that!

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.310
A bomb!?

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:26.180
It is!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.910
Choco bomb.

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:29.810
It is.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.510
When we finally got the ingredients...

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:32.460
Ichigo!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:35.010
Are all of you alright?

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:36.390
Honey-sama!

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:42.470
I saw Kashi and the others just now...
This was the doing of Whalzer, wasn't it?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.310
Ichigo was abducted!

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:45.300
Ichigo?

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:48.140
I-I mean... A friend.

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.230
Vanilla, join up with me.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:55.360
The rest of you should get back to the academy and continue your work.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.660
But, the ingredients are...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:02.090
We will share our ingredients with you all.

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:04.160
Let's go, Vanilla.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:04.850
Yes.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:10.940
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.320
What are you doing? Hurry up!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.000
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.230
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:24.590
Owwie...

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.420
You...

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.380
Don't you have any wings?

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:29.620
You must have had a bitter life.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.000
But, having no wings is better for your health.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.630
If you keep flying, you will get fat a lot quicker.

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.980
It will be troublesome to keep a diet with them.

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:41.110
Really? I think If I could fly it'd be a lot better...

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.770
The growth of wings varies with people.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.330
So you don't have to worry too much about it. You will definitely grow them.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:51.560
We aren't interested in you. We just want the ingredients.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:56.380
Why? There's lots of sweets in the forest, so why are you stealing from others?

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.250
It's a lot easier, obviously!

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.300
I have seen this idiot somewhere...

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.670
Let's go, Andi, Narcy.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:04.710
Yeah.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:05.580
Stop right there.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:14.310
You three, how long are you going to continue such behaviour!?

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:19.110
If you all go back to the academy, and study how to make sweets properly,

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.490
I might plead for leniency from the Queen.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.540
If you don't have your spoons, you all won't be able to use Sweets Magic, right?

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.040
Shut up! You Honey Pig!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.670
Honey... Pig?

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.170
If you're vexed, then chase after us!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.130
Yay~ Honey Pig~.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:41.010
What are they saying towards Honey-sama? That's so rude.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.430
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:47.460
Huh? You have wings...

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.170
What is your name?

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.490
It's Amano...

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:51.770
Freizu!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.140
Freizu.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:56.870
Freizu? I've never heard that name before...

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:59.530
I-I just transferred here, that's why.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:07.320
Ah, of course. I stayed in the human world for too long, so I don't know the new faces. I'm sorry for that.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:08.760
Don't worry about it.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.390
Where did Vanilla go?

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:14.370
Ah, here! I'm right here. Honey-sama is definitely not a Honey Pig.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.720
T-That's fine already...

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:20.390
I'll return to the lake to get ingredients.

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:22.760
You all should return to the academy.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.590
Yes.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.740
Being able to fly really is great...

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:30.390
But flying like Vanilla is a bit...

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.390
What do you mean? Are you saying that Vanilla is dinosaur!?

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:36.080
Wasn't Ichigo called the Cake Pig before?

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.350
It's big stomach king.

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.030
So it isn't Cake Pig.

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:41.390
That's rude! Vanilla is totally a dinosaur, isn't she!?

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.900
What's that!?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:11.780
Choco choco banana, choco banana... Vanilla!

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:13.780
What is Vanilla doing?

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:16.940
She was using Sweets Crafts to make something just now.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:20.140
Vanilla is not involved in making Sweets Crafts.

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.770
She's probably slacking off!

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.110
There! Now it's fine.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.120
Wow! I'm the same as everyone else!

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.730
Thank you, Vanilla.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:33.160
I still have some work to do, so you should tour the city.

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:35.050
Yep. I'll do that.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.160
I found you.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:39.040
Don't slack off!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.050
I-I'm not really slacking off...

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.340
Don't give me any excuses! We're busy after all!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:47.090
We'll meet at the celebration tonight, so you have to go back before it starts.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:54.100
I didn't manage to tour the city before being brought to the forest just now.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:57.570
The Kingdom of Sweets is such a fun place, just like a fairy tail.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.100
Oh? That is..!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:03.260
As I thought, they are sweets! How cute!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:15.050
Everything looks so delicious. I can't resist anymore.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:19.120
Come to think of it, has the fireworks thief from before been caught yet?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.170
It doesn't seem so.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.800
What are they doing, I wonder?

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.000
Huh?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.180
Found him!

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.200
If I only could fly now...

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:05.500
Huh? This is...

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:09.590
I'm certain that I fell into a hole.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.210
Girl...

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:15.000
Girl... you mean me?

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:18.350
That's right. Human girl.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:22.300
Umm, well, I'm not...

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.020
What's up with this drumstick spoon?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:29.240
It's a spoon that opens the door to your future.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.450
This drumstick spoon?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.790
Other than that, right now, I'm interested in knowing...

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:41.750
Follow that path of light and you'll meet the Spirit you're looking for.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.090
Huh? Why...

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:48.190
Grandmother...

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:52.510
This year's Newear's theme is white colour.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.280
It seems to be held on the east side of the castle.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.860
You did it! Destruction fits our preys perfectly!

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.430
How is the construction?

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.780
It's already done. I tested it and it works perfectly.

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:03.970
Ah, I can't wait until nightfall...

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.020
The one from before.

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:14.070
Cannot-fly-chan.

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:19.340
Oh? You've gotten wings? That's great!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:21.660
Nope, these are Sweet Crafts.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:24.500
The one who made this must be that dinosaur Spirit, right?

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.620
If it's us, we can make them a lot prettier.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.250
Delicious!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.290
Thank you.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.120
Merci.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:34.470
What did you come here for?

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:36.550
Have you come to get revenge for those stolen ingredients!?

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:40.500
That's wrong. I was curious why you all are here.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:45.560
You can create such delicious cookies,
why don't you go back to the academy?

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.560
It's none of your business.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.690
But...

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:55.800
Those three did something, and angered the Queen. So she confiscated their spoons.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.770
That means they can't use Sweets Magic?

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:01.510
That's why he used a wooden spoon...

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:07.520
But if you let the Queen taste these delicious cookies, I'm sure she'll forgive you.

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:13.990
That's what we said too. But Kashi can't forgive himself.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.070
What do you mean?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:21.680
There was a certain contest in making sweets, and Kashi stole a recipe of the top-class pâtissier...

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:27.680
We didn't know that, and we won using the recipe for making the sweets.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:35.870
But when the Queen found out the recipe was stolen, which angered her, she took away our spoons.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:41.000
Kashi can't forgive himself for involving us,
who didn't know anything about it.

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:44.030
But we can't leave him like this.

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:49.750
We always relied on Kashi. He also did this for us.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.240
Kashi is also very stubborn.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:55.260
You don't show one bit of reflection at all for the mistakes you've made.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.500
The last part is Sweets Magic. Everyone, here we go.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.010
There!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.430
Oh, isn't it Maron?

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:23.890
Have you still not come into the human world?

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:28.250
There won't be a partner that fits me. Either way it's pointless.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:32.260
That's not true. I met a human that fits your perfectly.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.130
Fits me perfectly?

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:37.200
Her bad personality is also the same as yours.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.630
You should go and see her at least.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.130
Oh? Sounds intriguing.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:44.590
You're late, aren't you?

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.950
Yeah. Has it already begun?

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.090
It's about to.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.350
What's up with that drumstick spoon?

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.350
I got it from a grandma in the forest.

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:53.170
Oh?

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:01.770
Go! To the east side of the castle!
I'll destroy the Newear's celebration.

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:03.940
Hurry up and close the gates.

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:07.270
Honey-sama, just let everyone use Sweets Magic and give him a beating.

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.780
I can't do that.

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:16.050
Our Sweets Magic is used for making beautiful sweets. It can't be used for destruction.

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:17.430
Kashi, look ahead!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.470
Cannot-fly-chan!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.470
Stop it!

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:24.410
Kashi, brake, brake!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.950
She can't fly. She'll be crushed!

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:27.970
Damn it!

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.210
Ichigo!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.900
Ah, it's a mess.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.270
Geez, you three, you really need to be punished!

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:52.750
Besides, for making a mess, we are going to get our bottoms spanked by the Queen.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:55.110
Ichigo, get a grip!

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:57.000
My stomach's full...

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.170
Q-Queen...

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.660
Thank you very much!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.930
Their cookies have been approved by the Queen.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.720
We're going to start the Newear's celebration.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.690
Yeah!

